, which of the following expresses the statement $∀x\\in (1,\\infty ),\\,P(x)?$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399382 1072 #uuid "6336cc3e-143c-5d52-83b4-52b2733f351b" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399382 1074 "The universal quantifier \"$∀$\" means \"for all.\" So, the statement \n$∀x\\in (1,\\infty ),\\,P(x)$ \nreads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **For all** $x\\in (1,\\infty ),$ ${x}^{2}>x.$\n\n**Note:** This statement is true." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399384 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399385 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399386 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399387 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399388 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399384 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399383 1080 #uuid "da2f987f-545e-5531-8f85-0b57a2cd730e" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399384 1081 "For all $x\\in (1,\\infty ),\\,\\,{x}^{2}>x.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399384 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399384 1084 #uuid "7ba36cad-3d3b-52fe-8da9-534ffd79e6c1" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1081 "For some $x\\in (1,\\infty ),\\,\\,{x}^{2}>x.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1084 #uuid "d6110e32-9a48-58f5-a9da-5ed70f94bf07" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399386 1081 "There exists at least one number $x\\in (1,\\infty )$ such that ${x}^{2}>x.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399386 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533